message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tensip"
abstract: >-
  Open source helper application that downloads a lawyer's case files from
  the UYAP Lawyer Portal (Turkish judiciary) into an organised local archive,
  keeps that archive in sync with the portal and shows the documents on the
  desktop. It only queries the portal and downloads documents; it does not
  file documents or sign anything. Tensip is not an official application and
  has no connection to the Ministry of Justice, UYAP or any bar association.
authors:
